      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I have a clear picture. Let me improve understandability by removing unused imports, using descriptive variable names, and adding a display name annotation to clarify each test's intent.The improved test compiled successfully. The changes made were: removed unused imports (`Jsoup`, `Document`, `HashMap`, `HashSet`, `NamespaceSvg`), renamed variables to descriptive names (`lowerScript`/`upperScript`, `lowerScriptFromTagSet`/`upperScriptFromTagSet`, `upperP`/`lowerP`), added `@DisplayName` annotations to each test, and added brief inline comments explaining the intent — all without altering any method calls, arguments, or assertions."
